            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.10.3+DEU.10.4+DEU.10.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 10.3-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " netii olperere lo lasar le nkorropil le sahabu o ilo sanduku losotua omura pooki alole te sahabu, netii atua ilo moti e sahabu natii mana, o enapa ng'udi e Aron natubulakita mbenek, o lapa soito lo sotua; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.18+EXO.25.19+EXO.25.20+EXO.25.21+EXO.25.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 25.18-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " netii ilkerubi le nkitoo ooitushurita ilo orika lo lng'ur. Ore kuna tokitin nimikindim aaimaki taata nikisipu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.2+NUM.18.3+NUM.18.4+NUM.18.5+NUM.18.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 18.2-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore pee eidipi aaitabai kuna kitobirat, neaku kejing ilapolosak anaake atua ilo ng'obor aaitabaya empolosare enye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.16.2+LEV.16.3+LEV.16.4+LEV.16.5+LEV.16.6+LEV.16.7+LEV.16.8+LEV.16.9+LEV.16.10+LEV.16.11+LEV.16.12+LEV.16.13+LEV.16.14+LEV.16.15+LEV.16.16+LEV.16.17+LEV.16.18+LEV.16.19+LEV.16.20+LEV.16.21+LEV.16.22+LEV.16.23+LEV.16.24+LEV.16.25+LEV.16.26+LEV.16.27+LEV.16.28+LEV.16.29+LEV.16.30+LEV.16.31+LEV.16.32+LEV.16.33+LEV.16.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 16.2-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kake ore ine e are, olapolosani kitok ake ojing, ore ninye naa kata nabo to lari, nemejing meetae osarge oishooyo te nkaraki kewan enye o te nkaraki inkitarruorrot e ilo orere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te na bae eitodolu Enkiyang'et Sinyati inchere eton mebolo enkoitoi najing'ieki ine wueji sinyati eton ake eitashe ilo ng'obor lioriong, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa ina enkitanyaanyukoto e na kata taata. Ore te risioroto ele rrekie neishoori inkishorunot, o lasarri lemeidim aaitaa supati indamunot elelo oosaisho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake endaa ake eipirta o enaoki o enkitukuore oo mpukunot kumok, naa imbaa naaitore osesen naatuunoki o metabau enkata enkibelekenyata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
