              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku meeta apake kata nemeitukui kuna tokitin naa inkitanyaanyukot ake e nekua e shumata aaipokie kulo asarri, kake ore nena tokitin maate e shumata neipokieki lasarri oolang kulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
